WEBVTT

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:11.130
Inukai-san, why are you wearing a dog costume?!

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.880
She's getting down on my level!

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:16.960
It's kinda nerve-wracking!

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:22.290
You know what this is, Pochita?

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:27.170
It's the DoggyLingus,
and it translates dog to human!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:31.000
The what? Do you realize
how questionable that sounds?!

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.080
Now I'll know how you really feel...

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.210
So... Do you love me?

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:48.210
C'mon, you don't seriously believe that old toy
can actually translate for me, do you?!

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.420
Really?!

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.290
Ugh, fine! We'll try it!

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:53.420
I love you!

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:05.210
Inukai-san!

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.330
Yosomi shinaide onrii wan na good boy

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:13.500
Kimi to ireba wandafuru ranran raifu

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.580
One, two, three de jump! Aijou atenshon

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:19.670
Three, two, one de turn! Kitai ijou supaaku

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:22.830
One to one de love! Gyakkyou furakushon

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:25.920
Asa kara ban made wandafuru ni saabisu

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:29.000
Daisuki datte tsutawatte little boy

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.580
Aishite! Aishite! Aisasete I want you

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:38.920
Boku o ikiro kanzen nenshou hashirinukero

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:45.630
Gooru wa atarashii jibun sa
(Go Beyond Yourself!)

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:51.420
Takaku hoero manshinsoui na kinou koete

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.460
Ashita no (aijou atenshon)
bokura no (gyakkyou furakushon)

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:58.670
Seiippai kagayaiteru

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:00.170
This is your life, your way!

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:01.830
This is my life, my way!

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:02.830
Wan!

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:11.500
<b>A Dog's Heart.</b>

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.000
She looks horrified.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.130
What did it say I said?

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:15.710
<b>I ain't messing with humans</b>

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:15.710
<b>who like cute widdle poodles!</b>

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.710
I didn't say any of those words!

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:25.040
She is desperate to get me to like her...

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.580
I don't think you wanna be
that desperate, though!

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.420
Karen, what was that noise?

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:37.040
Is everything...

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:39.420
What are you doing?

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:42.670
Awkward...

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.960
Push-ups.

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:47.880
While you're wearing dog ears?

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:51.210
And a tail?

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:56.000
Yeah, so?!

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.540
Don't hurt yourself, okay?

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:03.000
She totally bought it!

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.080
Uh, no! She did NOT!

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:09.830
Tell me the truth, Pochita.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.670
Am I weird?

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:18.000
Is it weird to be into stuff
most people wouldn't be into?

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:25.830
Wait! She said that back then, didn't she?

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.880
Senpai, guess who?

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:41.290
Y'know, you're the only one who
calls me Senpai around here.

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.420
Yeah, I know.

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:46.630
You're such a loner.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:50.500
The only person you talk to is me,
'cause we're both on garden duty.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.750
There's my Senpai from the soccer team!

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.540
Senpai!

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:05.000
In a weird way, I feel like I'm living in
a different world than them.

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:07.710
He can talk to people and stuff.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:10.460
Me, on the other hand...

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:13.250
I like plants.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:16.750
You don't have to talk to them
to be friends with them.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:19.130
Just give 'em water.

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:24.380
Inukai-san?!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:27.580
Do you like plants?

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:31.630
I-I guess.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:35.830
It's the Ice Queen herself... Inukai-san!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.330
I know it's weird for a guy to like gardening.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:41.210
That's usually a girl thing...

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.500
I'm too scared to look her in the eye!

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:46.040
Just because you're different
doesn't mean you're weird.

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:54.460
Just because you like something different
doesn't mean you're weird.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:56.580
You're not weird.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:02.210
And ever since she offered me
those kind words,

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:04.210
I've been crushing on Inukai-san...

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:08.290
But I didn't know what to say back then.

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:10.580
Now, though...

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.080
You're not weird!

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:16.830
Really?

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:20.540
I have no idea how DoggyLingus
translated that...

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:24.540
But I don't want to have to rely on
some cheap toy.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:28.960
One day, I'll tell her myself!

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.580
Nekotani?

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:43.040
Hey, Karen, I think I left my pen
at your place yesterday.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:45.960
Could you come bring it to me?

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:50.290
Also, we should totally study
at my place next time!

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:53.290
And you could walk Pochita over
while you're at it!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.330
Did you miss me, Pochita?

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:11.250
Inukai-san's been coming home
pretty late from school this week.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.960
She must be out having fun...

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:27.750
She's already getting into her PJs?

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:30.670
Gotta give her some privacy!

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:34.170
Inukai-san?!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.080
Huh?!

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.040
She's already passed out?!

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:46.880
She must be exhausted.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:50.960
Must be from all the fun
she's having after school.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:56.420
Wait! Now's the perfect time to put my
newest escape plan into motion!

00:06:57.630 --> 00:07:02.880
Inukai-san's gonna take me with her
to Nekotani's place this weekend.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:07.460
My house is right next to hers,
and I need to get over there!

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:11.000
I need to distract them
so I can escape outside.

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:14.790
Coming!

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:17.880
So, I'll send a package
to Nekotani's house...

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.290
Delivery!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.080
And right when she opens the door
for the delivery guy...

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.580
I'll be free!

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.250
Nothing can go wrong!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:36.880
But I've gotta get on Inukai-san's phone
to actually order the package.

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:41.920
That was close!

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:45.080
Inukai-san sure likes to toss and turn...

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:52.710
She's so cute in her pajamas...

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:56.290
No, stop it! I can drool over her later!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.460
<b>Unlock with fingerprint</b>

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.460
She's got a fingerprint lock on her phone...

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:06.040
Fine. Just gotta pull her hand over to it...

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:11.460
Huh?!

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:15.290
Oh, no!

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.460
I can't reach! Dammit!

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:25.380
Fine, I'll do this!

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:30.210
Inukai-san's super ticklish!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.250
How do you like this, huh?!

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:38.040
Oh, God...

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:39.750
Okay!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.670
Wait, does she...

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:47.960
Does she want me to lick her again?

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.920
Fine, how do you like
two hands, one tongue!

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:54.500
Lemme show you how talented
my tongue is now!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:11.380
I think I got her off... Me.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:22.330
Why is this her background?!

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:25.460
Forget it. Time to surf the web!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.580
It's hard to press the buttons
with my little paws.

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:32.080
Yes!

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:35.170
And I made sure it'll arrive
when we're over there!

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:38.080
Now I just gotta delete the search history...

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:41.040
<b>Student part-time job</b>

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:41.040
<b>Locodo Mart part-time job student</b>

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:41.250
I shouldn't look at her history, though!

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:45.040
Part-time jobs?

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:50.380
Oh, huh. Inukai-san's working part-time
to help pay for the stuff I need...

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:52.960
That's why she's been coming home so late.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:02.790
She cares so much for me right now,
but only 'cause I'm a dog.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:07.540
When I go back to being a human again,
we'll be as distant as ever.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:12.670
Do I really need to be human again, though?

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:22.580
Yes, I do! This isn't who I am!

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:25.880
And I don't like lying to Inukai-san like this!

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:32.670
Pochita...

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:36.630
I can't do that... Right?

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:44.960
Listen up, I don't want you cozying up
to Nekotani while we're at her place.

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:46.880
You got that, Pochita?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.540
Good! That's what I wanted to hear!

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.710
Just around this corner...

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.500
I'll finally get to see...

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.880
My house!

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:06.250
Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu!

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:09.880
Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu!

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:12.130
Let's go mai hausu!

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:16.710
Airashii sono sugata ni sukitte sukitte tomaranai

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:21.880
Watashi ga katte shiawase ni
suru kara kocchi oide yo

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:26.000
Kyawakyawa chu chu chu himitsu no hitotoki wa

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:31.040
Suki na mono ni massugu fureaeru daiji na jikan

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.580
Shitawatteru kono kimochi

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:35.960
Kakushiteta kono kimochi

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.330
Mitsuketa kono kimochi

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:40.000
Todoke! Todoke!

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.000
Da-da-da-da-da-da-da daisuki!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.710
Kataomoi kimi ni kitto tsutawarimasu you ni

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:50.080
Sono shigai kara miageta watashi ga itsuka

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:52.630
Kimi no numbaa wan ni naritai

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:55.500
Kokoro no soko kara I love you!
